
  stellar-mls dev-env agent container
  ------------------------------------
  workspace: ~/workspace
  role:      $ROLE   (set at container build time)
  tmux:      use `tmux new -A -s main` to attach/reattach

  remote-xcodebuild <sha>     — build iOS on the Mac host
  remote-jnilibs    <sha>     — build Android JNI libs on the Mac host

